        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 15:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wandu wa muzi ghwa Diboni, wajoka cha mghondinyi andu witasiragha, wipate kulila; wandu wa Moabu wialilia Nebo na Medeba. Wamerie kuara vongo vawo na sombe rawo kwa wasi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.15.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.15.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 15:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Warwa nguwo ra magunia na kuida achienyi wikilila kula umu wawo, na nyumbenyi na viwachenyi, wikidikwa ni mbori. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.15.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.15.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 15:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wandu wa Heshboni na Eleale, wialila, chwaka rawo rasikirika hata Jahazi. Kwa huwo masikari gha Moabu wiakema wikilila, wandu wose wa isanga wiasughusika. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.15.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.15.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 15:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngolo yapo ialilia isanga ja Moabu, wandu wake wiakimbiria isanga ja Soari na Eglathi-shelishia, wamu wiajokeria na mshoromoto ghwa Luhithi wikilila, na wamu wiaghenda wikilila kwa wasi cha Horonaimu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.15.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.15.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 15:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Machi gha Nimrimu ghaomie, nyasi reeoma na zima nderiwuebuka, hata mghina ghungi ndeghuko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.15.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.15.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 15:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa huwo wandu waawuyaduka vilambo wivipatire, na ivo werewikieghe na kuruwuka navo Vololo ya midi ya mierezi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.15.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.15.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 15:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kililo chaawuyasikirika kula andu isangenyi ja Moabu, na wandu wa Eglaimu na Beer-elimu wiadikwa ni mbori. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.15.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.15.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 15:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hata ngera machi gha Diboni ghachulwa ni bagha, ela sena Mlungu uchawiredia wandu wa Diboni wasi m'baa kuchumba; awo wichaasigharika na kukimbia, Mlungu uchawiredia shimba ipate kuwibwagha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.15.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.15.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
